# Vendored map assets — NOT committed, on purpose.
#
# ~21 MB of OpenStreetMap-derived vector tiles, glyphs and sprites from OpenFreeMap.
# They are a third-party ODbL database, not our source, and a git repository is the
# wrong place to redistribute one. Rebuild them in ~2 minutes with:
#
#     npm run tiles
#
# See docs/ARCHITECTURE.md ("Offline basemap") for what the pack contains and why the
# map is bundled rather than fetched at runtime.
public/tiles/
public/fonts/
public/sprite/
public/styles/

